1
00:00:06,117 --> 00:00:08,006
The day I proposed to you

2
00:00:08,366 --> 00:00:11,812
you asked me to be honest with you always, didn't you?

3
00:00:13,032 --> 00:00:16,089
You said that you are and that you will always be.

4
00:00:17,584 --> 00:00:21,635
From that day to today

5
00:00:21,635 --> 00:00:25,661
I lied to you a lot because I didn't want to hurt your feelings.

6
00:00:27,288 --> 00:00:29,072
My sister is getting a divorce.

7
00:00:29,072 --> 00:00:32,376
Sang Jin came to my house because of that.

8
00:00:33,555 --> 00:00:35,758
I was going to tell you but I didn't find the right time.

9
00:00:36,786 --> 00:00:40,587
I also hid and lied about many things.

10
00:00:41,410 --> 00:00:45,713
I get why you misunderstand the situation about me and Dong Bi.

11
00:00:47,528 --> 00:00:56,349
I understand how you felt when I didn't
answer your call and stayed with Sang Jin.

12
00:00:57,681 --> 00:01:01,143
Dong Bi is my friend but she's also your friend.

13
00:01:01,686 --> 00:01:04,137
I met her before I met you.

14
00:01:04,137 --> 00:01:07,818
Dong Bi dated Ki Joong because I introduced her to him.

15
00:01:07,818 --> 00:01:12,644
Whenever Dong Bi went through
difficult times dating Ki Joong,

16
00:01:12,644 --> 00:01:15,370
I felt sorry because I thought I had caused the problem.

17
00:01:15,370 --> 00:01:20,235
I also felt bad for her.

18
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:27,572
I thought a man and woman could be friends, as
long as one doesn't have feelings for the other.

19
00:01:28,237 --> 00:01:33,587
All three of us got along very well and you didn't get annoyed by it.

20
00:01:33,587 --> 00:01:36,600
So I thought it wouldn't be a problem. I'm sorry.

21
00:01:37,534 --> 00:01:40,644
Because I thought I shouldn't get jealous.

22
00:01:40,644 --> 00:01:43,938
I was annoyed but I trusted you and her.

23
00:01:46,099 --> 00:01:48,987
When you lied about Sang Jin,

24
00:01:48,987 --> 00:01:54,603
I wanted to create the same situation
so you can feel what I felt.

25
00:01:54,603 --> 00:02:00,022
But I realized how petty I was after
that situation actually came about.

26
00:02:01,293 --> 00:02:07,055
Before I met you, there was a moment
that I thought I loved somebody.

27
00:02:08,600 --> 00:02:12,917
But while I loved you, I felt ashamed of that love.

28
00:02:12,917 --> 00:02:18,061
I wished you were the first man.

29
00:02:22,841 --> 00:02:26,511
Hae Yoon, I'm not Prince Charming.

30
00:02:27,046 --> 00:02:29,057
And I can't be your father.

31
00:02:31,561 --> 00:02:33,565
I want to be respected as a man.

32
00:02:34,224 --> 00:02:37,621
But sometimes I want to be weak and comforted by somebody.

33
00:02:40,392 --> 00:02:42,013
I am sorry.

34
00:02:42,013 --> 00:02:44,047
We all have weakness.

35
00:02:44,047 --> 00:02:47,548
I felt inferior to you while
preparing for the wedding, just like you.

36
00:02:49,177 --> 00:02:50,736
As you know

37
00:02:50,736 --> 00:02:52,323
I am ambitious.

38
00:02:53,216 --> 00:02:55,955
I want my life to be simple.

39
00:02:56,863 --> 00:03:01,163
I just want to love my wife and raise my child.

40
00:03:01,163 --> 00:03:04,289
And I want to enjoy life with a little bit of money.

41
00:03:05,440 --> 00:03:08,662
I thought I could have that life with you.

42
00:03:10,591 --> 00:03:15,162
I thought if I love somebody, I should do whatever she wants.

43
00:03:15,689 --> 00:03:18,773
But now I don't know if that's love.

44
00:03:19,806 --> 00:03:22,606
I think our lives start now.

45
00:03:26,124 --> 00:03:30,949
I thought it was both of our parents who caused the problems while preparing the wedding.

46
00:03:30,949 --> 00:03:32,692
But that was not it.

47
00:03:36,204 --> 00:03:38,812
The problem was you and me.

48
00:03:38,812 --> 00:03:43,831
The problems you and I have were the biggest obstacles.

49
00:03:46,182 --> 00:03:50,151
I don't know who I really am.

50
00:03:50,151 --> 00:03:52,112
I think I'm...

51
00:03:54,390 --> 00:03:59,906
one of the goods made by a social convention.

52
00:04:03,077 --> 00:04:08,224
Jun Sang Jin and Dong Bi might become problems as we live on.

53
00:04:09,087 --> 00:04:12,063
What's important is where our heart goes.

54
00:04:13,602 --> 00:04:18,556
The problems we both can work out is
different than what I can work out.

55
00:04:19,527 --> 00:04:22,408
It's best that I should be alone now.

56
00:04:32,781 --> 00:04:39,518
If we get back together, I wish it happens
because we love each other so much.

57
00:04:41,701 --> 00:04:45,327
Thank you for respecting me.

58
00:04:47,127 --> 00:04:49,933
Let's go now.

59
00:04:54,888 --> 00:04:56,989
We can at least shake our hands, right?

60
00:04:58,759 --> 00:05:01,682
No, I am not going to.

61
00:05:01,682 --> 00:05:04,830
If I do, I might not let you go.

62
00:05:04,830 --> 00:05:07,023
Then don't let it go.

63
00:05:10,061 --> 00:05:13,757
No. Good bye.

64
00:06:21,741 --> 00:06:23,201
Do you open today?

65
00:06:24,420 --> 00:06:27,298
We do. But the menu is limited.

66
00:06:27,298 --> 00:06:33,811
And we will take a while. But I'll refill the menu as much as you want, just today.

67
00:06:36,532 --> 00:06:38,392
Are you getting undressed already?

68
00:06:38,392 --> 00:06:40,013
Do you not want me to?

69
00:06:40,013 --> 00:06:43,156
I haven't seen you in Han Bok in a long time.

70
00:06:43,519 --> 00:06:46,271
But I have to go meet somebody.

71
00:06:46,271 --> 00:06:50,654
- Ah, Hae Yoon's mom?
- Today will be the last time to see her.

72
00:06:50,654 --> 00:06:53,595
Be nice. Don't hurt her feelings.

73
00:06:53,595 --> 00:06:57,298
She hurts my feelings. I don't.

74
00:07:00,676 --> 00:07:03,747
- I'm on time, aren't I?
- Yeah. It will take only two hours.

75
00:07:03,747 --> 00:07:06,538
When can I get Hae Yoon's invitation?
The wedding is soon, isn't it?

76
00:07:06,538 --> 00:07:09,564
She will give it when she think it's the right time.

77
00:07:10,217 --> 00:07:12,457
- Bye.
- Bye.

78
00:07:19,789 --> 00:07:21,063
Hey.

79
00:07:21,063 --> 00:07:23,590
- Am I late?
- I came early.

80
00:07:23,590 --> 00:07:25,576
- What do you want to drink?
- I ordered already.

81
00:07:25,576 --> 00:07:30,557
I ordered what you always drink. It saves us time too.

82
00:07:30,557 --> 00:07:33,407
She's trying to win me, isn't she?

83
00:07:33,407 --> 00:07:38,547
I should've told you this earlier. I canceled the wedding hall.

84
00:07:38,547 --> 00:07:40,074
Now you act so fast.

85
00:07:40,074 --> 00:07:46,019
I asked my son and he said nothing
suspicious happened between him and Dong Bi.

86
00:07:46,019 --> 00:07:49,143
That's not proof. That's just an excuse.

87
00:07:49,143 --> 00:07:54,640
I asked my husband about
that since he met Hae Yoon.

88
00:07:54,640 --> 00:07:59,214
He said it's not because of Dong Bi.
It was my mistake.

89
00:07:59,214 --> 00:08:02,257
There must be a reason why you thought like that.

90
00:08:02,257 --> 00:08:04,446
He said she broke up because she loves him.

91
00:08:04,446 --> 00:08:08,200
What? What the hell are you talking about?

92
00:08:08,200 --> 00:08:11,049
Why would they break up because they love each
other? People break up if they don't.

93
00:08:11,049 --> 00:08:16,279
I think she had an inferiority complex.

94
00:08:16,279 --> 00:08:19,112
Why does my kid have an inferiority complex?

95
00:08:19,112 --> 00:08:21,910
She's pretty and has a nice job.

96
00:08:21,910 --> 00:08:23,547
But you're not.

97
00:08:23,547 --> 00:08:26,067
I know. Why would she have that?

98
00:08:26,067 --> 00:08:32,296
We met and talked because of our kids.

99
00:08:32,296 --> 00:08:34,609
But we didn't have them married.

100
00:08:34,609 --> 00:08:37,109
I wish Hae Yoon can meet a nice man.

101
00:08:38,962 --> 00:08:42,028
I don't know if Jung Hoon can meet a nice woman.

102
00:08:42,028 --> 00:08:44,186
He still can't get over her.

103
00:08:44,186 --> 00:08:48,251
I met him a while ago and he said he
will wait for her. I felt so bad.

104
00:08:48,251 --> 00:08:50,499
He will forget about her as time goes.

105
00:08:50,499 --> 00:08:54,925
There are things that can and cannot be
forgotten as time goes on.

106
00:08:54,925 --> 00:08:59,435
I know these parents who were against their
son's marriage and ruined his life.

107
00:08:59,435 --> 00:09:05,001
Now he's 40 and still not married.
They are so worried that he can't get married.

108
00:09:05,001 --> 00:09:07,353
They regret what they have done to him.

109
00:09:07,353 --> 00:09:10,390
The children's opinions are the most important.

110
00:09:10,390 --> 00:09:15,470
I know that but I think their families are important too.

111
00:09:15,470 --> 00:09:16,830
Of course they are.

112
00:09:17,113 --> 00:09:21,755
If a mother-in-law is so picky about her bottom
drawers, then she's a bad mother-in-law.

113
00:09:21,755 --> 00:09:25,003
A marriage isn't a business.

114
00:09:25,003 --> 00:09:27,510
My family wasn't like that.

115
00:09:27,510 --> 00:09:30,368
I don't know what kind of in-law family she will meet next time.

116
00:09:30,368 --> 00:09:34,744
Parents who have a son is criminal these days.

117
00:09:34,744 --> 00:09:38,635
A long time ago, the husband and wife
live with the husband's family.

118
00:09:38,635 --> 00:09:42,004
So the in-law family took care of them
but these days, they live separately.

119
00:09:42,004 --> 00:09:44,680
Anyways, thank you for everything.

120
00:09:44,680 --> 00:09:50,564
We talked and I got to experience a new culture.

121
00:09:50,564 --> 00:09:54,140
She's sick. What is a new culture?

122
00:09:55,798 --> 00:09:59,919
I also experienced a new culture because of you.

123
00:10:01,198 --> 00:10:05,358
I've never heard the saying parents who have a son are criminals.

124
00:10:05,358 --> 00:10:06,708
She never loses.

125
00:10:06,708 --> 00:10:11,340
Now the relationship between you and my family
is done here. A successful conclusion.

126
00:10:11,340 --> 00:10:15,245
You can't win over your child though.
I'll make Jung Hoon take my side.

127
00:10:15,245 --> 00:10:17,814
Sure. A successful conclusion.

128
00:10:19,021 --> 00:10:21,740
Then good bye. Thank you for everything.

129
00:10:21,740 --> 00:10:23,774
Thank you for not clinging to me.

130
00:10:23,774 --> 00:10:26,057
Sure. Bye.

131
00:10:36,856 --> 00:10:40,427
- Good bye.
- Good bye.

132
00:10:42,185 --> 00:10:47,225
An inferiority complex? I don't understand.
What's wrong with Hae Yoon?

133
00:10:47,225 --> 00:10:48,973
What is the true reason?

134
00:10:48,973 --> 00:10:52,130
Now it's finally done. I feel so good.

135
00:11:06,654 --> 00:11:08,273
- Hey.
- Your phone isn't roaming yet.

136
00:11:08,273 --> 00:11:10,316
- I know you know about this.
- Is that really true?

137
00:11:10,316 --> 00:11:13,546
Yeah. She got me at the airport.

138
00:11:13,546 --> 00:11:17,422
Yeah. But how did you know that fast?

139
00:11:19,772 --> 00:11:23,411
I can't even hide my private life.

140
00:11:23,411 --> 00:11:27,680
You tell everybody. Don't make them call me.

141
00:11:43,778 --> 00:11:46,008
How could this happen?

142
00:11:46,363 --> 00:11:49,354
I can't believe that bitch really did that.

143
00:11:50,907 --> 00:11:53,466
Are you not mad?
Are you having a party now?

144
00:11:56,136 --> 00:12:00,884
I can't believe you. You didn't know?
You didn't know this would happen?

145
00:12:00,884 --> 00:12:02,250
Wasn't she suspicious?

146
00:12:02,250 --> 00:12:05,443
She was. She was very suspicious. So I thought she's naturally suspicious.

147
00:12:05,443 --> 00:12:07,275
I'm not letting this go.

148
00:12:07,275 --> 00:12:10,848
Then are you going to tell people that
you're avenging a woman who fooled your son?

149
00:12:10,848 --> 00:12:13,765
All the people know. Even the press knows about this.

150
00:12:13,765 --> 00:12:15,552
I turned my phone off.

151
00:12:16,020 --> 00:12:19,423
Don't avenge her. You look so immature.
Let's just let it go.

152
00:12:19,423 --> 00:12:21,243
How can I let it go?

153
00:12:35,784 --> 00:12:37,355
Do you want to sleep here tonight?

154
00:12:38,225 --> 00:12:39,225
I don't like this house.

155
00:12:39,225 --> 00:12:41,475
If I see the outside from the window, I feel like jumping out the window.

156
00:12:41,475 --> 00:12:42,997
How can you say that in front of your kid?

157
00:12:42,997 --> 00:12:48,142
How can I not? You're the only one who knows everything about me.

158
00:12:48,142 --> 00:12:50,956
- How's Dad?
- He's freaking out more than I am.

159
00:12:50,956 --> 00:12:52,819
Her father's business will suffer.

160
00:12:52,819 --> 00:12:54,559
Your dad said he won't get any products from their company.

161
00:12:54,559 --> 00:12:58,079
- Stop him.
- Find another woman. You should get married.

162
00:12:59,356 --> 00:13:01,397
I'm not listening to you anymore.

163
00:13:01,397 --> 00:13:03,555
- What?
- I did once.

164
00:13:03,555 --> 00:13:05,865
- I don't think I have to do it again.
- What are you talking about?

165
00:13:05,865 --> 00:13:09,882
I think you used all your veto cards.

166
00:13:09,882 --> 00:13:13,872
That's what I thought. But I got one now.
This is so humiliating.

167
00:13:13,872 --> 00:13:17,306
You won't feel as humiliated as I am.

168
00:13:17,306 --> 00:13:19,678
Chae Young is a woman that Dad brought.
He should take the responsibility.

169
00:13:19,678 --> 00:13:22,856
What you should remember is I did get married.

170
00:13:22,856 --> 00:13:26,312
Just like you wanted me to.
I'm getting married to a woman I love.

171
00:13:26,312 --> 00:13:28,799
No way. Who said you can do that?

172
00:13:28,799 --> 00:13:31,947
You know how I am if I decide to do something.

173
00:13:33,688 --> 00:13:36,502
- Nobody can convince me.
- I'm about to decide to do something.

174
00:13:37,546 --> 00:13:40,755
When I changed my mind to be a cook, I
thought that was my last time to decide.

175
00:13:40,755 --> 00:13:47,245
But now the situation is different.
So you and Dad should think about it differently.

176
00:13:48,313 --> 00:13:50,607
I'll do something else for you but not the marriage.

177
00:13:50,607 --> 00:13:54,668
Why? Do you want to have a daughter-in-law
who will have a miserable life like you?

178
00:13:54,668 --> 00:13:57,534
Does misery love company?
Are you going to be best friends with her?

179
00:13:57,534 --> 00:14:02,788
Yeah, you're right. I want to have
somebody that suffers what I suffered.

180
00:14:02,788 --> 00:14:08,342
I forgot that you like to make people's
lives miserable just because yours is.

181
00:14:25,939 --> 00:14:28,905
- You must be tired.
- I'm so tired.

182
00:14:28,905 --> 00:14:29,905
Do you want something to drink?

183
00:14:29,905 --> 00:14:31,542
- You know it, don't you?
- Know what?

184
00:14:31,542 --> 00:14:33,337
The reason why Hae Yoon broke up.

185
00:14:33,337 --> 00:14:35,423
I don't know. How would I?

186
00:14:36,026 --> 00:14:39,915
Then find out. She's a sharp spoon.

187
00:14:39,915 --> 00:14:41,957
Even if she's not confident, she should've said she is.

188
00:14:41,957 --> 00:14:45,282
She's perfect. Why did she say she lost to reality?

189
00:14:45,282 --> 00:14:48,652
She is talking a load of bollocks.
There must be a real reason.

190
00:14:49,677 --> 00:14:51,246
Did you hear something from somebody?

191
00:14:51,884 --> 00:14:55,324
Jung Hoon's mother has no answer.

192
00:14:55,324 --> 00:14:58,443
I usually don't say that but she doesn't have an answer.

193
00:14:58,443 --> 00:15:03,067
She's so immature since she just stays at home after meeting a husband like a Buddha.

194
00:15:03,067 --> 00:15:04,788
She doesn't care about other people.

195
00:15:04,788 --> 00:15:09,065
Hae Yoon thinks I'm the worst?
I think Jung Hoon's mom is worse than I am.

196
00:15:09,065 --> 00:15:11,027
Why do you keep seeing her then?

197
00:15:11,027 --> 00:15:13,696
I'm trying to get them back together.

198
00:15:13,696 --> 00:15:15,506
You don't like Mrs. Ha. Why?

199
00:15:15,506 --> 00:15:18,981
But Mr. Ha is a great man.
Hae Yoon didn't get a father's love.

200
00:15:18,981 --> 00:15:21,435
It'd be nice if she feels a warm love from him.

201
00:15:22,191 --> 00:15:24,493
Mrs. Ha can't do anything if Mr. Ha says something.

202
00:15:24,493 --> 00:15:26,648
But Hae Yoon doesn't want it. We should respect her.

203
00:15:26,648 --> 00:15:29,962
Why doesn't she want it? Jung Hoon said he will wait.

204
00:15:29,962 --> 00:15:32,115
He said there's something Hae Yoon needs to figure out herself.

205
00:15:32,115 --> 00:15:34,256
What is it that you and I don't even know about it?

206
00:15:34,256 --> 00:15:36,084
Hae Yoon will figure it out herself.

207
00:15:36,084 --> 00:15:38,545
So what has she done so far?

208
00:15:38,545 --> 00:15:42,331
All she had to do was walk into the
wedding hall but she canceled it.

209
00:15:42,331 --> 00:15:45,188
Then she's not ready to get married confidently.

210
00:15:45,188 --> 00:15:47,142
Don't say that.

211
00:15:48,643 --> 00:15:51,477
I didn't tell neighbors that Hae Yoon's wedding was called off.

212
00:15:51,477 --> 00:15:54,043
I think Jung Hoon is the right guy for her.

213
00:15:54,043 --> 00:15:55,161
What about Sang Jin?

214
00:15:55,161 --> 00:15:58,344
He's such a sly guy. I don't like him.

215
00:15:58,344 --> 00:16:01,334
Sang Jin is a back up.

216
00:16:01,334 --> 00:16:06,911
But I haven't seen his parents yet. I think Jung Hoon is perfect for her.

217
00:16:07,722 --> 00:16:11,367
She calculated right. Her calculation was right.

218
00:16:11,367 --> 00:16:15,375
So don't say anything about it. Just find out the reason. I'll solve the problem.

219
00:16:15,375 --> 00:16:16,834
Okay.

220
00:16:16,834 --> 00:16:21,990
I should get involved. If I leave it up to you guys, you only waste time.

221
00:16:27,445 --> 00:16:31,004
- What took you so long?
- The maid is taking the day off tomorrow.

222
00:16:31,004 --> 00:16:33,154
So I prepared breakfast for tomorrow.

223
00:16:33,154 --> 00:16:37,404
You didn't have to do that. You're so lovely.

224
00:16:37,404 --> 00:16:39,762
- Sit down.
- I'll take a shower first.

225
00:16:43,819 --> 00:16:45,458
Hey, Aunt.

226
00:16:46,799 --> 00:16:49,464
Really?

227
00:16:50,676 --> 00:16:53,457
I can't believe this.

228
00:16:53,457 --> 00:16:56,155
Are you sure about it?

229
00:16:56,155 --> 00:16:59,398
I feel bad for Ki Joong.

230
00:16:59,764 --> 00:17:03,465
Alright. She's so bad.

231
00:17:03,465 --> 00:17:07,962
Okay. I'll call my sis tomorrow.

232
00:17:08,833 --> 00:17:12,052
- Okay.
- Did something happen to Ki Joong?

233
00:17:12,052 --> 00:17:13,947
I can't believe it.

234
00:17:13,947 --> 00:17:16,990
- How could this happen?
- Did something happen on the honeymoon?

235
00:17:16,990 --> 00:17:21,090
They didn't even go. The bride disappeared at the airport.

236
00:17:21,090 --> 00:17:22,828
She planned it all.

237
00:17:22,828 --> 00:17:25,876
She had a boyfriend but her parents were against it.

238
00:17:25,876 --> 00:17:27,685
So she used Ki Joong.

239
00:17:27,685 --> 00:17:29,732
- Then what's going to happen?
- I don't know.

240
00:17:29,732 --> 00:17:33,328
He must be shocked and so must his parents.

241
00:17:33,328 --> 00:17:35,298
Just pretend you didn't hear about it for a while.

242
00:17:35,298 --> 00:17:39,569
No. She felt sorry for me when Jung
Hoon's marriage was called off.

243
00:17:39,569 --> 00:17:44,021
I should feel sorry for her now.
This is worse than what happened to Jung Hoon.

244
00:17:45,220 --> 00:17:47,638
Marriage causes so many problems to many families.

245
00:17:48,598 --> 00:17:50,520
Where are you going?

246
00:17:56,956 --> 00:17:58,885
I was going to come to you anyway.

247
00:17:58,885 --> 00:18:00,706
- Why?
- This.

248
00:18:00,706 --> 00:18:01,939
What's this?

249
00:18:03,233 --> 00:18:05,845
She gave these when she broke up with me.

250
00:18:10,573 --> 00:18:14,652
She's so weird. I gave them to her as a gift.
Why did she give them back to me?

251
00:18:14,652 --> 00:18:16,214
What should I do with them?

252
00:18:16,214 --> 00:18:19,471
- Then what should I do?
- I don't like her.

253
00:18:19,471 --> 00:18:23,089
You keep them until you get a new girlfriend and then give them to her.

254
00:18:23,089 --> 00:18:25,884
How can I do that?
It was Hae Yoon's once. You're...

255
00:18:25,884 --> 00:18:29,634
Fine. Don't get mad at me.
I want us to be like before.

256
00:18:29,634 --> 00:18:31,622
Before Hae Yoon was involved between us.

257
00:18:31,622 --> 00:18:33,728
Am I dating you or something?

258
00:18:33,728 --> 00:18:36,834
- Why do you keep talking back to me?
- Because you're making me do that.

259
00:18:36,834 --> 00:18:38,645
Fine. I'm sorry.

260
00:18:38,645 --> 00:18:40,872
I'm sorry for talking back to you.

261
00:18:40,872 --> 00:18:46,508
Don't be. I know how you feel but
I feel so angry seeing you sad.

262
00:18:47,130 --> 00:18:50,145
Ki Joong's marriage went wrong. I came to tell you this.

263
00:18:50,145 --> 00:18:53,191
You should know it so you don't
make any mistakes like him.

264
00:18:53,191 --> 00:18:55,783
Why did it go wrong? It was a business.

265
00:18:55,783 --> 00:18:58,714
A business can fail.
Not every business goes well.

266
00:19:05,686 --> 00:19:08,473
- Are you ready?
- Yeah.

267
00:19:08,473 --> 00:19:10,852
Then do it.

268
00:19:18,641 --> 00:19:21,476
- Put me down if you can't.
- I'm going to do it.

269
00:19:21,476 --> 00:19:24,641
Thank you. This is my idea of romance.

270
00:19:26,371 --> 00:19:30,683
If we enter this room, we can finally do it!

271
00:19:30,683 --> 00:19:32,444
Let's go.

272
00:19:39,835 --> 00:19:41,537
Oh my god.

273
00:19:41,537 --> 00:19:45,044
I'm going to do it no matter what.

274
00:19:45,044 --> 00:19:46,617
Are you okay?

275
00:19:46,617 --> 00:19:48,836
I'm not.

276
00:19:48,836 --> 00:19:51,884
- Shit.
- Did you just say shit?

277
00:19:51,884 --> 00:19:55,153
Yeah. You must be in pain.
Come here.

278
00:19:57,408 --> 00:19:59,935
- I'll bring some hot packs.
- Wait.

279
00:19:59,935 --> 00:20:03,307
- I think it's not hurting me anymore.
- You think?

280
00:20:03,307 --> 00:20:06,257
- Then it's not hurting you anymore.
- But it actually hurts.

281
00:20:06,257 --> 00:20:09,208
I'm in pain because of you.

282
00:20:10,679 --> 00:20:14,988
Then I'm the medicine.
Let me give you some treatment.

283
00:20:19,925 --> 00:20:21,371
What do you think?

284
00:20:22,798 --> 00:20:25,019
- The pain is gone.
- Really?

285
00:20:25,019 --> 00:20:28,815
- Look at this.
- It is gone!

286
00:20:28,815 --> 00:20:31,361
- Are you that happy?
- Yeah!

287
00:20:56,126 --> 00:20:58,247
Father...

288
00:21:09,774 --> 00:21:11,761
Why aren't you answering my phone call?

289
00:21:15,065 --> 00:21:18,642
Please stay out of my life.

290
00:21:28,940 --> 00:21:30,417
What's all this?

291
00:21:30,417 --> 00:21:32,918
I don't know. I woke up early.

292
00:21:32,918 --> 00:21:36,078
Don't do that. You must be tired.

293
00:21:36,078 --> 00:21:37,400
Let's just have some bread.

294
00:21:37,400 --> 00:21:40,817
I wanted to do it. It was so romantic.

295
00:21:40,817 --> 00:21:43,619
Making breakfast for someone I love.

296
00:21:43,619 --> 00:21:45,246
Your idea of romance is very practical.

297
00:21:45,246 --> 00:21:47,694
I want to be a good girlfriend. Don't you remember how we met?

298
00:21:47,847 --> 00:21:49,342
How did we meet?

299
00:21:49,342 --> 00:21:52,076
I don't know. How did we meet?

300
00:21:52,076 --> 00:21:55,996
I think I saw you for the first time when you poured water for Ki Joong.

301
00:21:55,996 --> 00:22:00,235
Yeah. That was quite memorable.

302
00:22:00,235 --> 00:22:05,597
A man and a woman are so interesting.
I never imagined us to be like this back then.

303
00:22:05,597 --> 00:22:10,913
That's why a life is worthy to live.

304
00:22:10,913 --> 00:22:15,465
As you live life, unexpected things can happen.

305
00:22:16,022 --> 00:22:18,760
You do everything what others do.

306
00:22:18,760 --> 00:22:21,496
- So you don't like it?
- I like it.

307
00:22:47,993 --> 00:22:50,147
You're so cute.

308
00:22:54,771 --> 00:22:57,436
- Sorry I called you a busy man.
- It was your call. I should come.

309
00:22:57,436 --> 00:23:00,371
I have a goal to reach now. Take this.

310
00:23:01,712 --> 00:23:05,925
I found out you like dolls. So I bought Browny. He's a hit these days.

311
00:23:05,925 --> 00:23:09,749
- Browny?
- Get rid of the teddy bears.

312
00:23:09,749 --> 00:23:11,610
It's not for you.

313
00:23:11,610 --> 00:23:14,892
He's going to control me if he becomes my son-in-law.

314
00:23:14,892 --> 00:23:18,519
- Okay.
- Put him in you room.

315
00:23:18,707 --> 00:23:20,493
Okay.

316
00:23:26,747 --> 00:23:28,465
- Mrs. Jung.
- Yes?

317
00:23:28,465 --> 00:23:31,428
Wouldn't it look good if you put him next to the teddy bears?

318
00:23:33,556 --> 00:23:36,112
Sure. You're so sweet.

319
00:23:36,112 --> 00:23:38,615
He's always butting in my business.

320
00:23:38,615 --> 00:23:41,785
I was happy that you like dolls.

321
00:23:41,785 --> 00:23:43,454
People who like dolls are not bad.

322
00:23:43,454 --> 00:23:44,845
You thought I was bad?

323
00:23:44,845 --> 00:23:50,531
I'm just saying. You're kind of cranky.
Are you going to give me some tea or food?

324
00:23:55,164 --> 00:23:58,666
I asked you to come because I think you might know.

325
00:23:58,666 --> 00:23:59,505
Know what?

326
00:23:59,505 --> 00:24:02,808
What did Hae Yoon say about her break up?

327
00:24:02,808 --> 00:24:07,103
I didn't hear the reason from her but it won't
be just one reason. It's probably complicated.

328
00:24:07,103 --> 00:24:08,271
Why do you ask?

329
00:24:08,271 --> 00:24:11,446
I need to know that. Can you find out?

330
00:24:11,446 --> 00:24:16,179
It can be inferred from all the situations
she had. Do you have to know the reason?

331
00:24:16,179 --> 00:24:19,056
I should know the reason, so as not
to make the same mistake.

332
00:24:19,056 --> 00:24:21,978
We can never be sure that
something like this won't happen again.

333
00:24:21,978 --> 00:24:23,725
What did Hae Yoon say?

334
00:24:23,725 --> 00:24:28,282
She said she lost to herself and reality.
She wasn't confident about the marriage.

335
00:24:28,951 --> 00:24:32,376
What do you think the reason is?

336
00:24:32,376 --> 00:24:37,620
Since she's talking around the subject, the reason is a person.

337
00:24:37,620 --> 00:24:40,156
If she says directly who the person is, that person's feelings get hurt.

338
00:24:40,156 --> 00:24:42,220
So she made up the reasons.

339
00:24:42,220 --> 00:24:45,341
I know. So who is that person?

340
00:24:45,341 --> 00:24:47,631
I think it's you.

341
00:24:47,631 --> 00:24:49,879
Me? Me?

342
00:24:49,879 --> 00:24:52,643
Yeah. Was I too direct?

343
00:24:52,643 --> 00:24:57,139
You're speaking nonsense.
You went too far.

344
00:24:58,171 --> 00:25:00,763
I think it's reasonable.

345
00:25:00,763 --> 00:25:04,501
It was because of her own mother?
What did I do wrong?

346
00:25:04,501 --> 00:25:05,983
No way.

347
00:25:05,983 --> 00:25:10,326
Well. How others think about you is different
than how you think about yourself.

348
00:25:10,326 --> 00:25:12,714
I think you should leave now.

349
00:25:13,883 --> 00:25:15,376
I'm sorry if you're mad.

350
00:25:15,376 --> 00:25:18,233
I thought you were good at this but you aren't.

351
00:25:18,233 --> 00:25:21,377
Then I'll leave now.

352
00:25:21,377 --> 00:25:23,260
Bye.

353
00:25:24,183 --> 00:25:28,537
Hug Browny when you sleep.

354
00:25:37,184 --> 00:25:39,232
He's kind of saucy.

355
00:25:40,860 --> 00:25:43,451
You look saucy too.

356
00:25:48,197 --> 00:25:52,478
What is the real reason? It can't be me.

357
00:25:53,382 --> 00:25:57,767
Is it really a person? Who is the person?

358
00:26:10,906 --> 00:26:14,292
Sis. I'm so sorry.

359
00:26:15,678 --> 00:26:18,044
- Are you happy?
- What?

360
00:26:18,044 --> 00:26:22,908
You felt sorry for me when Jung Hoon's
marriage was canceled. So I came here.

361
00:26:22,908 --> 00:26:25,652
The restaurant is opened. I thought it'd be closed.

362
00:26:25,652 --> 00:26:29,164
This shows people that my son is totally fine with that.

363
00:26:29,164 --> 00:26:32,300
- You're here.
- Yeah. You opened the restaurant.

364
00:26:32,300 --> 00:26:36,099
Yeah. other cooks are taking a day off so I cook today.

365
00:26:36,099 --> 00:26:37,624
I only take reservations.

366
00:26:37,624 --> 00:26:40,462
- Don't work too hard.
- I'm not.

367
00:26:40,462 --> 00:26:42,842
I'll leave you two alone now.

368
00:26:44,842 --> 00:26:48,313
He looks too fine.
He must have suffered a lot.

369
00:26:48,313 --> 00:26:51,652
He gets stronger when the critical situation comes.

370
00:26:51,652 --> 00:26:55,291
That's not true. He's a human and has a heart.

371
00:26:55,291 --> 00:26:59,779
He has to try harder to look fine like that.

372
00:26:59,779 --> 00:27:02,066
- I feel bad.
- What do you know?

373
00:27:02,066 --> 00:27:05,361
We have our own ways to overcome situations like this.

374
00:27:05,361 --> 00:27:07,489
Where's Chae Young?

375
00:27:07,489 --> 00:27:12,354
I don't care where she is. She humiliated
her parents. I bet she won't be happy.

376
00:27:12,354 --> 00:27:16,097
How could she do such things like this? Who is her boyfriend?

377
00:27:16,097 --> 00:27:18,358
You have so many questions.

378
00:27:18,358 --> 00:27:22,366
I'm sorry but I'm so curious.
How's she going to live anyways?

379
00:27:22,366 --> 00:27:24,455
She doesn't need to worry about that at least.

380
00:27:24,455 --> 00:27:26,660
She planned everything.

381
00:27:26,660 --> 00:27:31,116
Her father gave her money when
she got married. She's clever.

382
00:27:31,116 --> 00:27:34,127
I feel bad for her father for having a daughter like her.

383
00:27:34,127 --> 00:27:37,267
I'd never forgive my child if he did the same thing.

384
00:27:37,267 --> 00:27:39,804
I already feel bad for your future daughter-in-law.

385
00:27:39,804 --> 00:27:41,897
I feel bad for your future daughter-in-law.

386
00:27:41,897 --> 00:27:46,707
She's going to have to endure your
self-deluded snobbiness. I'm not like that at least.

387
00:27:46,707 --> 00:27:49,152
I think that's better than horror.

388
00:27:49,152 --> 00:27:51,546
Your family will take a hit because of the disengagement.

389
00:27:51,546 --> 00:27:53,660
But my family won't take a hit
even if he divorces three times.

390
00:27:53,660 --> 00:27:55,458
This is called dignity.

391
00:27:55,458 --> 00:27:57,053
I shouldn't have come here.

392
00:27:57,053 --> 00:28:00,899
If I talk to you for 30 minutes,
I feel like I've talked to you for three hours.

393
00:28:00,899 --> 00:28:04,229
That means I make people concentrate on me when I talk.

394
00:28:04,229 --> 00:28:06,279
You need to get along with your husband.

395
00:28:06,280 --> 00:28:09,624
You're doing this because you want to get attention.

396
00:28:09,624 --> 00:28:13,891
Are you giving me advice?
You came to comfort me? No, you did not.

397
00:28:13,891 --> 00:28:16,593
I must be a comfort to you. My life itself must be comforting to you

398
00:28:21,115 --> 00:28:24,487
Geez, seriously, she's such a drag

399
00:28:31,127 --> 00:28:32,993
How is everything going?

400
00:28:32,993 --> 00:28:37,765
Well for the first 2 years, it will be hard to make ends meet. I don't expect the company to grow so fast

401
00:28:37,765 --> 00:28:43,375
that's a good thinking. Not too vain. That's why I invested in your business

402
00:28:44,026 --> 00:28:48,086
I am thinking of planning a simple wedding and link it with city hall or church

403
00:28:48,086 --> 00:28:51,342
like an event for couples who never had wedding ceremony

404
00:28:51,342 --> 00:28:53,716
I thought you were just focusing on online presence, you're thinking about targeting offline clients as well?

405
00:28:53,716 --> 00:28:55,924
I am toyhinking about mixing the two.

406
00:28:55,924 --> 00:29:02,030
Have you heard? Chaeyong. She married Gong Kijoon

407
00:29:02,030 --> 00:29:07,321
I didn't tell you since you knew Chairman Gong's son

408
00:29:07,321 --> 00:29:10,421
Even though she doesn't look it, Chaeyong has a complicated dating life.

409
00:29:11,994 --> 00:29:13,676
[wicked patriarch]

410
00:29:14,693 --> 00:29:16,967
I have to answer this call

411
00:29:22,808 --> 00:29:24,845
Where are you

412
00:29:37,649 --> 00:29:41,067
-Is this your office?
-what would you like to drink?

413
00:29:41,067 --> 00:29:43,158
no need

414
00:29:43,158 --> 00:29:47,112
can you even work here? It's size of a shoebox

415
00:29:47,112 --> 00:29:49,486
what do you want to say exactly?

416
00:29:50,313 --> 00:29:51,803
I asked you to look over some stuff

417
00:29:51,803 --> 00:29:53,325
Why would I review that?

418
00:29:54,710 --> 00:30:00,006
Would you like me to kill that punk? If you want me to, I will. I will find a way

419
00:30:00,006 --> 00:30:06,339
He hurt you. If someone hurts you, you need to chase him to the ends of the earth

420
00:30:06,339 --> 00:30:08,977
that's my child

421
00:30:09,987 --> 00:30:13,311
I don't know why you show up all of a sudden, talking about your child and all

422
00:30:13,311 --> 00:30:16,538
I most certainly cut all ties with you, father

423
00:30:17,406 --> 00:30:19,870
Can you cut ties just because you say so?

424
00:30:19,870 --> 00:30:29,515
no. I changed my last name, left your household, and tried all I can to live a different life from you. But the persistent gene inside me went and found a guy exactly like you

425
00:30:30,524 --> 00:30:35,954
I thought if I could earn that guy's love, I will be repaid for all the love that I couldn't get from you, father

426
00:30:35,954 --> 00:30:38,921
If you want to stab him, stab yourself first

427
00:30:38,921 --> 00:30:41,134
who hurt whom?

428
00:30:41,134 --> 00:30:44,382
that's why I don't deal with girls

429
00:30:44,382 --> 00:30:48,273
It's enough I gave birth to you and here you talk about love nonsense. That's why it just doesn't work with girls

430
00:30:48,273 --> 00:30:51,489
How did Jungdo leave this world? Whose fault was it?

431
00:30:51,489 --> 00:30:53,903
Don't bring his name up. He's not my son

432
00:30:53,903 --> 00:30:56,382
If he was my son, he wouldn't have been such a weakling

433
00:30:56,382 --> 00:31:01,288
When he was seven years old, I dragged Jungdo to a mountain in the middle of the night because I wanted to kill him

434
00:31:01,288 --> 00:31:05,269
No matter how hard I try, I couldn't become a boy

435
00:31:05,269 --> 00:31:08,804
I thought you would pay attention to me if he was gone

436
00:31:08,804 --> 00:31:11,860
I have to keep Jungdo buried in my heart for the rest of my life.

437
00:31:11,860 --> 00:31:14,769
Do you know how painful that is?

438
00:31:15,711 --> 00:31:18,372
I have absolutely no fantasies about you, father

439
00:31:19,230 --> 00:31:22,728
What happened to Jungdo? The one you loved so much

440
00:31:24,557 --> 00:31:28,246
I don't need your love.

441
00:31:30,301 --> 00:31:36,969
You could become an actor. I have heard enough of your nonsense. Come back to the company now.

442
00:31:36,969 --> 00:31:39,667
The company doesn't have any talented people?

443
00:31:39,667 --> 00:31:42,145
The fact that you are my bloodline, that puts you above anyone else

444
00:31:42,145 --> 00:31:45,194
There are still companies that run under such old fashioned way?

445
00:31:45,990 --> 00:31:49,594
That means the company will fail. I'm not going into a company that has no vision.

446
00:31:49,594 --> 00:31:55,573
You're being very arrogant. I understand that you changed after leaving the family and going through hard times.

447
00:31:55,573 --> 00:31:57,013
But did somebody tell you to leave?

448
00:31:57,013 --> 00:32:01,632
The world is my family. My older sisters didn't give me a single call.

449
00:32:02,582 --> 00:32:08,799
Even if I left home, they were afraid if you found out that they keep in touch, you will cut off any financial support. They were afraid to lose their inheritance

450
00:32:08,799 --> 00:32:13,809
Is that family? Tell me truthfully. You are trying to use me as a shuttle, right?

451
00:32:14,638 --> 00:32:17,299
Your second wife's son is seven years old, right?

452
00:32:17,299 --> 00:32:22,891
Until he has grown... until he can take over the company...

453
00:32:23,752 --> 00:32:26,657
Are you shocked since I saw through you?

454
00:32:26,657 --> 00:32:31,878
- Pathetic girl.
- You can never win me.

455
00:32:31,878 --> 00:32:34,521
Time is on my side.

456
00:32:34,521 --> 00:32:38,942
When my time comes, you will have no choice but to stand behind me.

457
00:32:38,942 --> 00:32:41,932
Your wealth! if you die, I have my share in it

458
00:32:41,932 --> 00:32:45,767
I just have to wait. Stop trying to do something with me for money.

459
00:32:47,310 --> 00:32:50,282
It's a shame. Why were you born as a girl?

460
00:32:50,282 --> 00:32:54,160
With your gut and spirit, why couldn't you have been a boy?

461
00:32:54,160 --> 00:33:00,520
I am going to try to understand you because you are a pitiful person.

462
00:33:02,711 --> 00:33:05,764
If you have money lying around, invest in me.

463
00:33:05,764 --> 00:33:09,528
Don't waste your time doing background checks.

464
00:33:13,206 --> 00:33:18,926
I know this makes no sense, but I'm telling you since you do things that don't make sense.

465
00:33:19,341 --> 00:33:23,424
Don't touch that man.

466
00:33:23,424 --> 00:33:26,942
Love or work, I am going to take care of it with my own hands.

467
00:33:34,131 --> 00:33:36,015
Please leave now.

468
00:33:58,883 --> 00:34:00,501
What are you doing here?

469
00:34:02,518 --> 00:34:05,332
There is no reason to see each other. I give you back the bracelet

470
00:34:05,332 --> 00:34:08,541
You have become so much more attractive
than when I dated you.

471
00:34:08,541 --> 00:34:10,218
Why is that?

472
00:34:10,218 --> 00:34:12,632
I guess it's because I didn't love you.

473
00:34:12,632 --> 00:34:16,984
I think so too. I feel competitive to win you back. Let's date again.

474
00:34:17,930 --> 00:34:21,249
Why are you being like this? It hasn't been a long time since I called off the engagement.

475
00:34:21,249 --> 00:34:23,457
When I heard that you are no longer with that guy, I decided to do this.

476
00:34:25,911 --> 00:34:28,460
I am mourning for my love that didn't work out

477
